  "description": "<p>As a follow-on to: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393</a></p>\n\n<p>This task is to consolidate the spring configuration files of tests into a single \"fcrepo-config.xml\"... as done for the main build:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/spring/fcrepo-config.xml\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/spring/fcrepo-config.xml</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>The modules that need to be updated are:</p>\n\n<p>./fcrepo-http-api<br/>\n./fcrepo-auth-webac<br/>\n./fcrepo-kernel-modeshape<br/>\n./fcrepo-integration-rdf</p>",
